OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fend to the day with some evening
OL,7,Fsunshine. Overnight, areas of low
OL,8,Fcloud will reform, giving some hill
OL,9,Ffog and the odd spot of drizzle later
OL,10,Fover Cumbria. Another warm night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FLow cloud and hill fog will
OL,13,Flift to give some bright intervals.
OL,14,FHowever, cloudy for most with a few
OL,15,Fspots of rain and drizzle over hills.
OL,16,FFeeling warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
