OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be fresher with sunshine
OL,7,Fand a few showers. An isolated shower
OL,8,Fon Friday, though mostly dry with
OL,9,Ffurther sunshine developing at times
OL,10,Fheading into the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
